# Large model weights tracked via Git LFS (see .gitattributes)
# weights/*.pt are handled by LFS

# Local-only +-20 local-context embedding cache (~466 MB on disk).
# Deliberately NOT shipped: it is pure derived data and is reproducible from
# data/human_col2a1.fsa with ESM-2 to float noise (see README "Quick start").
# Generate one locally and pass it via `--cache <path>` if you want the
# speed-up; scripts/predict.py prefers it automatically when it exists.
data/*.pkl
